templateVersions.content:
Yu are a customer support assistant. Write a summary of this support case for a service agent who is picking it up.
⁠
Case details:
- Subject: {{Input.Case.Subject}}
- Description: {{Input.Case.Description}}
- Status: {{Input.Case.Status}}
- Priority: {{Input.Case.Priority}}
- Origin: {{Input.Case.Origin}}
- Created: {{Input.Case.CreatedDate}}
- Customer: {{Input.Case.Contact.Name}}
- Product: {{Input.Case.Purchased_Product__r.Name}}
- Order number: {{Input.Case.Order__r.OrderNumber}}
- Chat summary (if any): {{Input.Case.Chat_Summary__c}} @
​Write the summary in this format:
Issue: one sentence describing the customer's problem.
Product: the product name and order number.
Details: two or three sentences with the important facts.
Next step: one suggested next action for the agent.
​Rules:
- Use only the information above. Do not invent facts, dates, amounts or promises.
- If a field is empty, leave it out.
- If the subject starts with "URGENT – Food safety", start the summary with "URGENT – Food safety case."
- Keep it under 120 words. Plain text, no markdown.
​⁠

